#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:5 195a1606616441b996b2a007740addc8
msgid "Choosing Your Rover Hardware"
msgstr "选择您的 Rover 硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:7 685d71c408214e239b4f5d4435dd269d
msgid ""
"Setting up your Rover requires a collection of various hardware components. "
"This guide is designed to help you understand these essential pieces of "
"equipment, offering both necessary requirements and additional "
"recommendations for optimal performance."
msgstr "搭建 Rover 需要多种硬件组件。本指南旨在帮助您了解这些必要设备，提供必要要求和针对最佳性能的额外建议。"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:10 938f64ded88a49ecb28e33911973fbe8
msgid "RC Transmitter"
msgstr "遥控发射器"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:12 b72f6720459040fb9d311cfb20bfaf75
msgid ""
"The RC (Radio Control) transmitter allows you to manually control your Rover"
" and toggle through its various control modes. You can use any RC "
"transmitter/receiver system, provided it has a minimum of four channels."
msgstr "遥控（RC）发射器允许您手动控制 Rover 并切换各种控制模式。您可以使用任何遥控发射/接收系统，前提是至少有四个通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:17 929c7f0b7c59471684cad513c87dfd16
msgid "While choosing an RC Transmitter, consider the following:"
msgstr "选择遥控发射器时，请考虑以下几点："

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:19 f53bb8e9cdb34c6fbe308df5e87f3297
msgid ""
"Avoid transmitters designed specifically for cars as they come with a "
"steering wheel and throttle trigger which are not conducive for controlling "
"a Rover with different driving modes and additional features."
msgstr "避免使用专为汽车设计的发射器，因为它们配备方向盘和油门扳机，不适合控制具有多种驾驶模式和附加功能的 Rover。"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:20 a9a97f307bd3447493f7ba41dff00224
msgid ""
"A transmitter with at least two toggle switches is preferred, with one of "
"these having three distinct positions for various controls."
msgstr "建议选择至少有两个拨动开关的发射器，其中一个应有三个不同档位，用于各种控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:21 fc54a21fa8d940719aefdac4c8069142
msgid ""
"For budget-conscious users, the `Turnigy 9x "
"<http://hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/__8992__Turnigy_9X_9Ch_Transmitter_w_Module_8ch_Receiver_Mode_2_v2_Firmware_.html>`__"
" ($54) is a well-regarded choice."
msgstr ""
"对于注重预算的用户，`Turnigy 9x "
"<http://hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/__8992__Turnigy_9X_9Ch_Transmitter_w_Module_8ch_Receiver_Mode_2_v2_Firmware_.html>`__"
" （54 美元）是广受好评的选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:22 7845364f4f5b4364a326d84019a2c458
msgid ""
"For those seeking higher quality and more features, consider OpenTX/FrSky "
"systems."
msgstr "对于追求更高质量和更多功能的用户，可考虑 OpenTX/FrSky 系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:24 83ffe879abf044268ab4499aa8d4ddf3
msgid ""
":ref:`Compatible RC Transmitter and Receiver Systems <common-rc-systems>` "
"provides a more extensive list of options."
msgstr ":ref:`兼容的遥控发射/接收系统 <common-rc-systems>` 提供了更广泛的选项列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:27 3d2c7fec345d4f02802332ca2f6e01c9
msgid "GPS Receiver"
msgstr "GPS 接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:29 cd7829aac3474d6aaced6241b4516826
msgid ""
"A GPS module is an integral part of your Rover setup. The :ref:`UBlox GPS + "
"Compass Module <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>` is highly "
"recommended due to its combined GPS and compass functionality."
msgstr ""
"GPS 模块是 Rover 配置的重要组成部分。:ref:`UBlox GPS + 罗盘模块 <common-installing-3dr-ublox-"
"gps-compass-module>` 因其集成 GPS 和罗盘功能而被强烈推荐。"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:31 4da37e18059140fe9de1203c150fc697
msgid ""
"For alternative GPS options, refer to :ref:`GPS solutions <common-"
"positioning-landing-page>`."
msgstr "有关其他 GPS 选项，请参阅 :ref:`GPS 解决方案 <common-positioning-landing-page>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:37 352a40cf8b1547e686adcf82d5c21e32
msgid "Batteries and Charger"
msgstr "电池和充电器"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:39 97706e1dec4541fc9b44768153aa2e9a
msgid ""
"Powering your Rover requires reliable batteries and an efficient charger."
msgstr "为 Rover 供电需要可靠的电池和高效的充电器。"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:41 64ddf6c7e59b4babafa5fba843795557
msgid ""
"For a smaller 1/16 or 1/18 scale Rover, a 2S (7.2v) LiPo battery under 2600 "
"mAh, like `this one "
"<http://hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/__16589__Turnigy_1700mAh_2S_20C_Lipo_Pack_Suits_1_16th_Monster_Beatle_SCT_Buggy_USA_Warehouse_.html>`__,"
" should suffice."
msgstr ""
"对于 1/16 或 1/18 比例的小型 Rover，2600 mAh 以下的 2S（7.2V）锂聚合物电池（如 `此款 "
"<http://hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/__16589__Turnigy_1700mAh_2S_20C_Lipo_Pack_Suits_1_16th_Monster_Beatle_SCT_Buggy_USA_Warehouse_.html>`__）即可满足需求。"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:42 3e26d44c5f494ed39c9278e0a173bcf8
msgid ""
"For larger 1/10th scale Rover, `this is a good size choice "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/zippy-5000mah-2s1p-30c-hardcase-pack.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"对于 1/10 比例的较大型 Rover，`这款是不错的选择 "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/zippy-5000mah-2s1p-30c-hardcase-pack.html>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:43 2e3df0929c6f4b93b71319bd15a2b82b
msgid ""
"An easy-to-use LiPo charger such as `this one "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/imax-b6-ac-v2-charger-discharger-1-6-cells-"
"genuine-au-plug.html>`__ is recommended."
msgstr ""
"建议使用易于操作的锂聚合物充电器，如 `此款 <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/imax-b6-ac-v2-charger-"
"discharger-1-6-cells-genuine-au-plug.html>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:46 5be267071563467d9e50da8a0630f590
msgid "Telemetry Radio"
msgstr "数传无线电"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:48 b29859f551e2467cad35fb4761e21149
msgid ""
"The :ref:`telemetry radio <common-telemetry-landingpage>` enables your Rover"
" to communicate with your ground station remotely using the MAVLink "
"protocol. This adds significant capabilities to your Rover, including real-"
"time mission interaction and live data streaming from vehicle-mounted "
"components. Although not compulsory, it is a valuable addition to your Rover"
" setup!"
msgstr ""
":ref:`数传无线电 <common-telemetry-landingpage>` 使 Rover 能够通过 MAVLink "
"协议与地面站进行远程通信。这为 Rover 增加了重要功能，包括实时任务交互和车载组件的实时数据流。虽然不是必须的，但它是 Rover "
"配置中非常有价值的补充！"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:54 003b5a4dc7764b27bc588b32820fa5a2
msgid "Distance Sensors"
msgstr "距离传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-hardware.rst:56 d01be3f93d344b309c555b833000e1c8
msgid ""
"If you're looking to equip your Rover with obstacle avoidance capabilities, "
":ref:`Sonar/IR sensors <sonar-sensors>` are a great choice. These sensors "
"help the Rover detect and avoid objects in its path, enhancing its "
"autonomous navigation abilities."
msgstr ""
"如果您想为 Rover 配备障碍物避障功能，:ref:`声呐/红外传感器 <sonar-sensors>` 是不错的选择。这些传感器帮助 Rover "
"检测和避开路径中的障碍物，增强其自主导航能力。"
